  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "This Gu worm looks like a tiny scorpion. It has a unique appearance like folded paper. In the hand it is very light. When it moves its limbs there is a light sound, and it moves very slowly.",
        "chapters": [
          1092
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "It is a wisdom path Gu worm that produces a special type of will called self will, and cleansing oneself with it blocks and prevents the influence of heaven’s will. Fang Yuan calls these the best weapon against heaven’s will, and judges the recipe incomplete, suspecting Shadow Sect holds a better version.",
        "chapters": [
          1092
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_shadow_sect"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "He sends the Gu into Mini Northern Plains and activates them one by one until they are expended. Self will sweeps several battlefields and cleanses the heaven’s will there, except what remains inside snow monsters.",
        "chapters": [
          1092
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-in-the-immortal-aperture",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_mini_northern_plains"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan spends the Gu inside his aperture on Mini Northern Plains and snow monsters.",
        "chapters": [
          1095
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-against-heavens-will",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Against a desolate beast snow monster’s head he activates a huge amount of the Gu so self will fights the heaven’s will inside until that will is wiped out; even that costs hundreds of Gu for one head. The head explodes at the crucial moment, so cleansing the heaven’s will out of a snow monster does not let him subdue it, and he goes back to killing them. He also builds a sealing Gu formation with hundreds of self will Gu as the core, a method from Shadow Sect that seals heaven’s will.",
        "chapters": [
          1095
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "use-against-heavens-will",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_formation"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": false,
